{title: Wo Jab Yaad Aaye}
{artist: Mohammed Rafi Lata Mangeshkar Laxmikant Pyarelal}
{key: F}

{c: Verse 1}
[F]wo jab [C]yaad aaye, [F]bahot yaad aaye
[F]gam-e-zindagi ke, [G]andhere men [F]hum hain
[F]chiraag-e-mohabbat [C]jalaaye, [F]bujhaaye
[F]aahate [C]jaag uthhi, [G]raasate [F]hans diye
[F]thaamakar [C]dil uthe, [G]hum kisi [F]ke liye
[F]kai baar [G]aisa bhi [F]dhokha hua hain
[F]chale aa [C]rahe hai, [F]wo nazare jhukaye
wo jab yaad aaye,        [F] [C] [G] [F]
dil sulagane laga, ashk bahane lage,        [F] [C] [G] [F]
jaane kya kya hume, log kahane lage,        [F] [G] [F]
magar rote rote hansi aa gai hain,        [F] [C] [F]
khayaalon men aa ke, wo jab muskuraye,        wo jab yaad aaye
[F]wo [C]juda kya [G]huye, zindagi [F]kho gai
[F]shamma [C]jalati rahi, [G]roshani [F]kho gai
[F]bahoot koshishen [G]ki, magar [F]dil na bahala
[F]kai saaz [C]chhede, kai [F]geet gae
wo jab yaad aaye
